        {
          "text": "alimwi tulacita milimo miyumu amaanza esu tubeni, Ciindi ncitwaambilwa­ cisapi tulalumba, aciindi ncitupenzegwa tulaumuna buyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
